What's that?

00:14:35.410 --> 00:14:37.950
I wonder if it's some kind of good luck charm.

00:14:37.950 --> 00:14:40.150
Oh no, I have to hurry up and get changed...

00:14:40.150 --> 00:14:44.950
Say, your name is Ken, right? Help me!

00:14:44.950 --> 00:14:47.610
Can't you see me?!

00:14:48.120 --> 00:14:49.360
He's so useless...

00:14:49.360 --> 00:14:50.590
What?

00:14:50.660 --> 00:14:54.200
Hold on, please! You can't say that
with so little warning...

00:14:54.200 --> 00:14:56.730
Are you saying you can't cope with it?

00:14:56.730 --> 00:15:00.270
The trapeze team's act will completely change,
for one thing.

00:15:00.270 --> 00:15:03.870
Won't you please reconsider?
We'll pay plenty of attention to safety...

00:15:03.870 --> 00:15:05.170
I don't want to hear any more!

00:15:05.170 --> 00:15:09.730
A member of the Kaleido Stage
was injured just recently.

00:15:11.750 --> 00:15:14.920
Doing this without a net is out of the question.

00:15:14.920 --> 00:15:19.750
Also, it looks bad if the net shows
on screen when we're filming,

00:15:19.750 --> 00:15:22.260
so I'm putting it up as high as possible.

00:15:22.260 --> 00:15:23.360
What?!

00:15:23.360 --> 00:15:24.350
You're kidding!

00:15:24.830 --> 00:15:29.360
I'm sorry. It was my mistake,
not thinking of this beforehand.

00:15:29.360 --> 00:15:31.370
Anyway, we have to think of a way,

00:15:31.370 --> 00:15:34.900
or we'll hardly be able to do any of
the trapeze act we planned.

00:15:34.900 --> 00:15:36.700
It's a little late to be saying that now!

00:15:36.700 --> 00:15:38.430
I'll go take a look!

00:15:39.110 --> 00:15:40.870
I'll go too.

00:15:41.180 --> 00:15:44.180
The trapezes are up a lot higher too...

00:15:44.180 --> 00:15:47.250
The building is a pyramid shape, so
the high part is pretty narrow, huh?

00:15:47.250 --> 00:15:48.680
Hmmm...

00:15:48.680 --> 00:15:52.020
And we can't use the trampoline either
because the net's in the way.

00:15:52.020 --> 00:15:54.090
We can't put on much of a show.

00:15:54.090 --> 00:15:57.090
We'll be really far from the audience
if we do it there, won't we?

00:15:57.090 --> 00:15:57.890
Huh?

00:15:57.890 --> 00:16:00.430
Hey, that's right! May, do you have
any ropes or anything?

00:16:00.430 --> 00:16:02.300
No! Why would l?!

00:16:02.300 --> 00:16:04.170
I guess you wouldn't...

00:16:04.170 --> 00:16:05.430
Sora!

00:16:05.430 --> 00:16:10.200
I brought spare trapezes and rope
just in case something happened.

00:16:10.200 --> 00:16:12.760
Wow, really?! You're amazing!

00:16:14.510 --> 00:16:17.040
This is great! Thanks, Ken!

00:16:17.040 --> 00:16:19.350
Just what you'd expect from
Mr. Useful Man, Ken!

00:16:19.350 --> 00:16:21.250
Aw, well...

00:16:21.480 --> 00:16:22.920
So what are we going to do with them?

00:16:22.920 --> 00:16:24.950
I have an idea.

00:16:24.950 --> 00:16:26.350
You help too, okay May?

00:16:26.350 --> 00:16:28.690
Of course I'm going to!

00:16:28.690 --> 00:16:31.930
Say, do you want to do the trapeze
with us too, Rosetta?

00:16:31.930 --> 00:16:34.230
What? Me on the trapeze too?

00:16:34.230 --> 00:16:35.660
Where do you get off deciding this by yourself?!

00:16:35.660 --> 00:16:38.570
Oh, no, there's just something
I want Rosetta to do...

00:16:38.570 --> 00:16:41.500
I'll do it! I'll do it, Sora.

00:16:41.870 --> 00:16:46.740
Is this okay? Rosetta still hasn't
really done the trapeze, you know.

00:16:46.740 --> 00:16:49.710
Yeah, but this isn't so difficult.

00:16:49.710 --> 00:16:52.550
I'll do my best, so please let me, May.

00:16:52.550 --> 00:16:54.980
All right, then.

00:16:54.980 --> 00:16:58.150
For now I'll just try doing what Sora says.

00:16:58.150 --> 00:17:00.590
After all, even if I fail it's Sora's fault.

00:17:00.590 --> 00:17:03.360
Okay, we haven't got much time
before we go on.

00:17:03.360 --> 00:17:05.390
Sora, explain the plan.

00:17:05.390 --> 00:17:06.650
Right!

00:17:09.330 --> 00:17:14.570
Now, can Sora make this stage her own?

00:17:14.570 --> 00:17:19.230
Or will the team break up and
fall apart in midair?

00:17:26.880 --> 00:17:31.050
You call this a plan, but it's mostly ad-lib, isn't it?

00:17:31.050 --> 00:17:35.150
It'll be okay. I think it'll go well if
I'm with you, May.

00:17:36.360 --> 00:17:40.460
Cater. Pillar. Cater. Pillar.
Cater. Pillar. Cater. Pillar.

00:17:40.460 --> 00:17:44.230
Turn around, turn around,
turn around, turn around.

00:17:53.070 --> 00:17:54.140
They're kind of into it...

00:17:54.140 --> 00:17:56.540
Oh no!

00:17:59.080 --> 00:18:01.100
Ow ow ow...

00:18:02.980 --> 00:18:04.690
They're WAY into him?!

00:18:04.690 --> 00:18:06.880
Here!

00:18:38.620 --> 00:18:41.780
And now it's finally time for Sora.

00:18:49.830 --> 00:18:52.460
I'll have Sora show me everything about her!

00:18:57.340 --> 00:18:58.340
What's with her?

00:18:58.340 --> 00:19:00.410
The show's just started and she's
already ad-libbing like that?

00:19:00.410 --> 00:19:01.810
Oo oo ah ah!

00:19:01.810 --> 00:19:03.670
Fine. Then I'll go too!

00:19:07.080 --> 00:19:07.780
Run, run, run, run...

00:19:07.780 --> 00:19:08.680
What the heck is that?

00:19:07.780 --> 00:19:08.680
Run, run, run, run...

00:19:08.680 --> 00:19:09.010
What the heck is that?

00:19:11.350 --> 00:19:14.750
Her ad-lib moves are getting bigger and bigger.

00:19:15.090 --> 00:19:17.280
I've never seen Sora like this before.

00:19:18.260 --> 00:19:21.820
This is totally different than the performances
I've seen from Sora up until now.

00:19:22.300 --> 00:19:23.800
Why is it...

00:19:23.800 --> 00:19:26.430
Up until now, whenever I saw Sora performing,

00:19:26.430 --> 00:19:28.500
I thought "l WILL beat her!"

00:19:28.500 --> 00:19:31.410
I thought no matter what happened,
I'd make her lose to me.

00:19:31.410 --> 00:19:36.900
But watching Sora's performance today, I'm
starting to feel this completely different feeling.

00:19:37.180 --> 00:19:38.480
I want to beat Sora.

00:19:38.480 --> 00:19:39.850
I want to beat her, but...

00:19:39.850 --> 00:19:41.580
Something is different.

00:19:43.880 --> 00:19:45.050
Sora's amazing!

00:19:45.050 --> 00:19:46.950
So this is the real Sora.

00:19:46.950 --> 00:19:48.290
Yes.

00:19:48.820 --> 00:19:52.310
It looks like the Sora who loves
the stage has come back.

00:20:00.770 --> 00:20:02.900
Rosetta, you're doing great!

00:20:10.640 --> 00:20:12.700
Fooled you!

00:20:13.450 --> 00:20:14.810
There!

00:20:15.980 --> 00:20:17.920
Jeez, that Rosetta...

00:20:18.190 --> 00:20:20.220
Okay May, here we go!

00:20:20.220 --> 00:20:21.560
Fine by me.

00:20:21.560 --> 00:20:22.750
There!

00:20:35.040 --> 00:20:37.400
Oo oo ah ah!

00:20:39.170 --> 00:20:43.410
What's with that move? I can do
a little thing like that too!

00:20:45.610 --> 00:20:47.280
They're smiling...

00:20:47.280 --> 00:20:48.580
I get it...

00:20:48.580 --> 00:20:52.070
Sora was always seeing scenes like this.

00:20:52.890 --> 00:20:56.950
Sora has the power to make this many smiles.

00:20:58.230 --> 00:21:00.030
The importance of a smile...

00:21:00.030 --> 00:21:00.960
Sis!

00:21:00.960 --> 00:21:02.700
You're amazing!

00:21:02.700 --> 00:21:04.930
You're so cool, sis!

00:21:12.970 --> 00:21:14.780
How about THIS?!

00:21:14.780 --> 00:21:16.280
Wow, awesome, May!

00:21:16.280 --> 00:21:18.010
Super!

00:21:19.680 --> 00:21:21.080
Oh, May!

00:21:21.550 --> 00:21:22.450
Good stuff!

00:21:23.120 --> 00:21:24.610
Amazing!

00:21:24.920 --> 00:21:27.940
What is this feeling?

00:21:35.900 --> 00:21:38.300
Oh, I'm sorry.

00:21:38.300 --> 00:21:40.670
You're always sleeping, so...

00:21:40.670 --> 00:21:42.500
It's fine.

00:21:43.600 --> 00:21:45.630
I'll change your flowers.

00:21:47.440 --> 00:21:52.750
I've been curious all this time
about that "Sophie"...

00:21:52.750 --> 00:21:55.080
Wondering who she is...

00:21:55.080 --> 00:21:57.380
Sophie is dead.

00:21:58.720 --> 00:22:01.150
She was in an accident, wasn't she?

00:22:01.760 --> 00:22:04.020
It's none of your business.

00:22:05.990 --> 00:22:09.760
Today's Kenneth Motors show
was pretty amazing!

00:22:09.760 --> 00:22:12.700
Lots of light was coming in
through the windows,

00:22:12.700 --> 00:22:16.840
and while I was jumping around on the trapezes,
it was like I was dreaming.

00:22:16.840 --> 00:22:19.410
It was like my heart got really wide,

00:22:19.410 --> 00:22:23.100
Like everybody else's feelings could fly
anywhere in the world with me...

00:22:23.810 --> 00:22:28.120
I understood clearly that it was
the kind of show I wanted to do.

00:22:28.120 --> 00:22:29.950
Oh, and May was also...

00:22:31.790 --> 00:22:35.060
Sekasu you ni muragaru Hard luck

00:22:35.060 --> 00:22:38.290
Nagasarete Time is over

00:22:39.290 --> 00:22:42.100
Yokoku douri Take it easy

