00:23:19.570 --> 00:23:23.430
We are alone. Surechigau

00:23:23.870 --> 00:23:24.840
What's going on?

00:23:25.070 --> 00:23:30.100
Koukai no hate ni deau true heart

00:23:30.740 --> 00:23:37.480
Naite mo waratte mo I'll be with U

00:23:40.620 --> 00:23:42.850
Next Kaleido Star: New Wings

00:23:43.220 --> 00:23:45.860
Only a demon can raise an angel.

00:23:45.860 --> 00:23:49.460
And so, thanks to Rosetta,
we're going to tour France!

00:23:49.460 --> 00:23:51.230
There we'll meet a mysterious person,

00:23:51.230 --> 00:23:53.700
and hear from him the true nature
of the Angel's Maneuver...

00:23:53.700 --> 00:23:56.170
And that person's name...

00:23:56.170 --> 00:23:59.940
Oh, ARGH! Who is this "Sophie"? Who? Who?!

00:24:00.540 --> 00:24:03.540
Next time on Kaleido Star,
"Leon's Amazing Past"

00:24:03.540 --> 00:24:04.950
Leon's Amazing Past

00:24:03.540 --> 00:24:04.950
